"Your language pair" = "两种语言";
"Start with the first language (Caps Lock light off). Switch to the second language with Caps Lock (light on), or choose either language directly from the input menu. Choosing the current language keeps it selected." = "默认使用第一语言（大写锁定灯熄灭）。按中／英键切换至第二语言（灯亮起），也可在输入法菜单中直接选择。再次选择当前语言不会切换。";
"Text in either language is translated into the other. Mixed text uses its dominant language; uncertain selections translate into the first language.\n\nSimplified Chinese supports pinyin. Other choices use direct typing and do not add a phonetic keyboard.\n\nSave to apply. Changing the pair starts with the first language. Caps Lock light support varies by keyboard." = "输入和划词均自动识别这两种语言，翻译为另一种。混合文本按主要语言判断；无法判断的划词内容默认翻译为第一语言。\n\n简体中文支持拼音，其他语言直接输入键盘文字，不会额外提供对应的拼音或假名键盘。\n\n保存后生效，修改语言组合后默认使用第一语言。大写锁定灯的同步效果取决于键盘支持。";
"{appName} starts with the first language in Languages. Use Caps Lock or either configured language in the input menu to switch. Direct input stays in the host; switching inside a draft is temporary." = "{appName} 默认使用「语言」中的第一语言。按中／英键切换，或在输入法菜单中直接选择。直接输入时文字进入当前输入框；组句中的切换仅对本次有效。";
"Both input translation and selection translation detect which language in your pair the text uses, then translate into the other. The selected input mode does not force the translation direction.\n\nAutomatic display is off by default. Enable it to show the translation as soon as the selection settles; otherwise click the Translate button.\n\nCopy from the top right; click outside to close. Select again to retry. The source text is never replaced." = "输入翻译和划词翻译共用两种语言，自动识别原文并翻译为另一种。当前输入模式不会强制改变翻译方向。\n\n自动显示默认关闭。开启后，选区稳定时直接显示译文；关闭时点击「译」按钮。\n\n右上角复制，点击外部关闭，重新选择文字可重试。不会替换原文。";
"Pinyin · Simplified Chinese candidates" = "拼音 · 简体中文候选";
"Pinyin · Traditional Chinese candidates" = "拼音 · 繁體中文候選";
"Typing engine planned · ABC typing only for now" = "输入引擎待接入 · 目前仅支持 ABC 直接输入";
"Keyboard: %@ · Direct typing" = "键盘：%@ · 直接输入";
"Keyboard unavailable on this Mac · ABC fallback" = "此 Mac 上没有对应键盘 · 使用 ABC";
"Could not load the input engine. Your draft is preserved." = "无法加载输入引擎，已保留当前组句。";
"Text in either language is translated into the other. Mixed text uses its dominant language; uncertain selections translate into the first language.\n\nChinese uses pinyin. Other available keyboards type directly with their native layout, including accents and script characters. Japanese and Korean typing engines will be added in a later stage; their translation is already available.\n\nSave to apply. Changing the pair starts with the first language. Caps Lock light support varies by keyboard." = "输入和划词均自动识别这两种语言，翻译为另一种。混合文本按主要语言判断；无法判断的划词内容默认翻译为第一语言。\n\n简体、繁体中文使用拼音。其他已接入键盘按对应语言的布局直接输入，支持重音符号和本语言文字。日语、韩语输入引擎将在后续阶段接入，翻译功能已支持。\n\n保存后生效，修改语言组合后默认使用第一语言。大写锁定灯的同步效果取决于键盘支持。";

"Caps Lock controls the input language: off uses the first language, on uses the second. Switching while composing confirms the highlighted candidate, inserts the source sentence, then changes language. There is no temporary language mode." = "输入语言以键盘中／英（Caps Lock）状态为准：灯灭使用第一语言，灯亮使用第二语言。组句时切换，会先确认当前高亮候选并将原句上屏，再切换语言。不再提供临时语言模式。";

"Caps Lock off: first language. Caps Lock on: second language. The input menu only shows the current language; use the keyboard to switch." = "中／英（Caps Lock）灯灭：第一语言；灯亮：第二语言。输入法菜单仅显示当前语言，切换请使用键盘。";

"Text in either language is translated into the other. Mixed text uses its dominant language; uncertain selections translate into the first language.\n\nChinese uses pinyin. Other available keyboards type directly with their native layout, including accents and script characters. Japanese and Korean typing engines will be added in a later stage; their translation is already available.\n\nSave to apply. The active language always follows the current Caps Lock state, including after changing this pair." = "输入和划词均自动识别这两种语言，翻译为另一种。混合文本按主要语言判断；无法判断的划词内容默认翻译为第一语言。\n\n简体、繁体中文使用拼音。其他已接入键盘按对应语言的布局直接输入，支持重音符号和本语言文字。日语、韩语输入引擎将在后续阶段接入，翻译功能已支持。\n\n保存后生效。当前输入语言始终遵循键盘的中／英（Caps Lock）状态，修改语言组合后同样如此。";

"%@ · Caps Lock: insert source, then %@" = "%@ · 中／英键：原句上屏后切换至%@";

"Learn frequently used words and phrases" = "记忆常用词语和短语";

"Rank Chinese and Japanese candidates using the words you confirm, including after restarting.\nLearning stays on this device. Turning it off uses the base ranking and preserves existing learning.\nSaved changes apply to the next composition." = "根据你确认的中文和日语词语调整候选排序，重启后仍然有效。\n学习记录保存在本机；关闭后使用基础排序并保留已有记录。\n保存后从下一次组句开始生效。";

"Text in either language is translated into the other. Mixed text uses its dominant language; uncertain selections translate into the first language.\n\nChinese uses pinyin. Japanese uses romaji with kana and kanji candidates. Other available keyboards use their native layout. Korean typing is not available yet; Korean translation is supported.\n\nSave to apply. The active language follows Caps Lock, including after changing this pair." = "输入和划词均自动识别这两种语言并翻译为另一种。混合文本按主要语言判断；无法判断的划词内容默认翻译为第一语言。\n\n中文使用拼音；日语使用罗马字输入，提供假名和汉字候选。其他已接入键盘使用对应语言的布局。韩语输入尚未接入，韩语翻译已支持。\n\n保存后生效。修改语言组合后，输入语言仍遵循中／英（Caps Lock）键的状态。";

"Enable Accessibility permission for {appName} to read selections in other apps. Typing itself does not need this permission.\n\nIf the selection position is unavailable, the popup appears beside the pointer once and stays there. Text in images is not supported." = "开启 {appName} 的辅助功能权限，以读取其他应用中的选中文字。输入功能本身不需要此权限。\n\n无法获取选区位置时，弹框在鼠标附近首次出现的位置保持不动。不支持图片中的文字。";

"Romaji · Hiragana, katakana and kanji candidates" = "罗马字 · 平假名、片假名与汉字候选";

"Confirm candidates with Space or a number first" = "请先按空格或数字确认候选";

"Confirm candidates before entering punctuation or numbers" = "请先确认候选，再输入标点或数字";
